\title{M6 · Full spaces and enrichment}
\taxon{Milestone}
\meta{id}{M6}
\meta{origin}{design/08-roadmap.md}
\meta{status}{planned}
\tag{milestone}

\p{Build the classifier and the full \code{Kan}, \code{Mat(Kan)}, \code{InfCategory}, \code{Cat_∞}, and span instances. Prove size-bounded limits and colimits of spaces (\ref{at-sp-0012}), full matrix comparison (\ref{at-rt-0008}, \ref{at-sp-0002}/3), required rigidification (\ref{at-sp-0008}), and construction closure. Establish \ref{at-sp-0001}/4 and the corresponding presheaf/coend clients. Operadic nerves are introduced when their corrected algebra construction is ready. The full span-module comparison \ref{at-sp-0005}(b), double comparison \ref{at-ft-0004}, and style-A comparison \ref{at-rt-0009} may require separate research submilestones; the narrower mandatory \ref{ms-foundation} categorical tests were not postponed to these comparisons.}
\p{\strong{Exit:} the full root monad model agrees with the bootstrap Segal-category interface, the formal theory applies, and the claimed presheaf category is cocomplete at stated sizes. \strong{Freeze:} the validated full spaces/enrichment interface.}
